WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.512
Here's how to start Claude Code from your Documents folder.

2
00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:07.102
Press ⌘ Command + Space to open Spotlight.

3
00:00:07.752 --> 00:00:09.785
Type “Terminal” and press Return.

4
00:00:10.435 --> 00:00:12.622
Terminal opens in your home folder (~).

5
00:00:13.272 --> 00:00:16.826
Type cd ~/Documents and press Return.

6
00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:20.507
pwd shows where you are: Documents.

7
00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:25.389
Type claude and press Return. Claude Code starts in this folder.

8
00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:29.156
That's it! You'll need Claude Code installed first.
